From 488eda1968b21eeb13a68aee854bc6cb786064d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:57:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): move a session into any gateway's project,
 creating it on the session's gateway [daveey]

Move-to-project ran session.workspace.move on the ACTIVE gateway, so a
session owned by another registry gateway (mac-mini) failed with
'session not found'. The move now runs on the session's own gateway; the
destination is that gateway's same-named project, created there when
missing (same home-relative folder, git-cloned from the source's origin
if the folder doesn't exist). Remote-only project lanes are now move
targets too.
